WEBVTT

00:08:59.495 --> 00:09:01.272
let's not have any at all.

00:09:02.404 --> 00:09:04.243
Hey, this is new.

00:09:04.267 --> 00:09:07.517
Did we just invent
preventive self-censorship?

00:09:09.166 --> 00:09:11.677
I think this is bigger than cartoons.

00:09:11.701 --> 00:09:14.323
This is about opinion and journalism.

00:09:14.347 --> 00:09:16.672
This, in the end, is about democracy.

00:09:18.872 --> 00:09:20.841
We now live in a world

00:09:20.865 --> 00:09:24.260
where moralistic mobs
gather on social media

00:09:24.284 --> 00:09:26.145
and rise like a storm.

00:09:26.724 --> 00:09:30.199
The most outraged voices
tend to define the conversation,